Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:04.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Assalam o Alaikum! Aaj NestPOS mein Product, Kitchen Item aur Recipe ka connection dekhein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.53,0:00:08.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,Product customer ko becha jata hai. Kitchen Item kaccha saman hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:13.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Recipe batati hai ke ek Product banane mein kitna saman lagta hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:18.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,Menu se Ingredients kholen. Yahan kitchen ka kaccha saman darj hota hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.57,0:00:22.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Misal: chawal, chicken, oil aur sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:27.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Har item ka unit, rate, maujooda stock aur kam se kam limit dikhti hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.23,0:00:31.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Stock limit se neeche jaye, to system khabardar karta hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:37.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Naya Kitchen Item add karne ke liye Add Ingredient dabayein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.94,0:00:42.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,Naam Tamatar, unit kg, rate nabbe rupay aur stock bees kg rakhein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.91,0:00:47.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,Kam se kam limit paanch rakhein. Save se item record mein shamil ho jata hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.21,0:00:53.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,Ab Product ko Kitchen Items ke saath jorne ke liye Recipes kholen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.17,0:00:57.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Beef Pulao ki recipe dekhein. Ek plate ke liye pao kilo chawal darj hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:01:01.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pachaas gram oil bhi darj hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.10,0:01:05.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,Ek Product mein kai Kitchen Items use ho sakte hain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.37,0:01:11.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Ab sale ka asar dekhein. Sale screen se ek Beef Pulao chunen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.08,0:01:15.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,CASH payment karein. Cart mein add karne par stock foran kam nahi hota.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.79,0:01:20.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bill final hone ke baad recipe ke mutabiq Kitchen Stock khud minus hota hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.92,0:01:27.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yaad rakhein: Product customer ko becha jata hai. Kitchen Item banane mein kharch hota hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.17,0:01:32.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Recipe dono ko milati hai. Har final sale par stock ka hisaab khud chalta hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:37.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Is tarah manual ginti nahi karni padti. Shukriya!
